// 2. READERS: the administrator, at setup and at reporting time. Hardest: someone moving a program's spreadsheet in for the first time. Not here: everyone whose records an import creates.
// 3. SERIES/SCALAR: neither — two actions, each a card.
// 4. IRREVERSIBLE: an import, once it writes; it gets the template so the file is right first.
// 5. CUT: an import history, scheduled exports, and per-column mapping.
